\newlabel{fig:flash_sd_kde}{{6}{12}{Average runtime (log-scale $y$-axis) of scikit-learn KDE, SD-KDE (Torch), and Flash-SD-KDE across $n_{\text {train}}$ in 1-D; annotations show observed runtimes.\relax }{figure.caption.9}{}}
\newlabel{fig:triton_large_util}{{7}{12}{Utilization of the 1-D Flash-SD-KDE kernel and SD-KDE (Torch) for large $n_{\text {train}}$ (powers of two up to $2^{16}$). Labels show the observed runtime for each data size; error bars are omitted because a single seed is used per point.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
